After a 28-day reward period ends, RugFreePump finalizes the reward snapshot and determines the eligible buyers and creators for that period.

The finalized reward amounts are then processed for distribution from the reward pool allocated to that period.

# When Rewards Are Distributed

Rewards are distributed after the reward period has been finalized.

The final snapshot determines:

- Which buyers are eligible.
- Which creators are eligible.
- Their final rankings.
- Their qualifying activity.
- Their calculated reward amounts.

The distribution process uses this finalized information rather than the changing rankings from an active reward period.

# Distribution Process

The distribution process is performed using the finalized reward snapshot.

Eligible rewards are processed in controlled batches so that the distribution can be completed safely and tracked accurately.

For each batch, the distribution process records the relevant reward recipients and amounts and tracks the transaction used to distribute the rewards.

This allows completed distributions to be verified against the finalized reward snapshot.

# Reward Distribution Status

A reward distribution may be processed across multiple batches.

A batch can progress through the required distribution steps before it is permanently recorded as completed.

The distribution records include the transaction signature associated with the completed reward transfer.

This provides a verifiable record of the distribution for the participants included in that batch.

# Your Reward

If you qualify for a reward, your final reward amount is determined by the finalized reward snapshot for the relevant 28-day period.

The amount is based on the reward program rules and the qualifying activity recorded for that period.

Your reward does not change because rankings change in a later reward period.

# Important Points

- Rewards are based on finalized 28-day reward periods.
- Only participants who qualify in the finalized snapshot receive rewards.
- Buyer and creator rewards are distributed from their respective portions of the reward pool.
- Distributions may be processed in multiple batches.
- Completed distributions are recorded with their transaction signatures.
- The finalized reward snapshot is the permanent reference for the reward period.

For how reward amounts are determined before distribution, see [Reward Calculation](/reward-program/reward-calculation).
